"""Batch settlement helper.

Bulk settlement runs the same arithmetic as the single invoice path, but it
operates on raw spreadsheet rows rather than on validated invoice lines.
Because the rows come straight from the exporter, every cell has to be
validated before it reaches the arithmetic -- an empty price cell is
exported as the literal text ``nan``, which would otherwise travel through
``Decimal``/``quantize`` and only blow up at ``int(...)`` with
``ValueError: cannot convert NaN to integer``.
"""

