"""Batch settlement regression tests.

The headless batch path settles raw spreadsheet rows. The exporter writes an
empty numeric cell as the literal text ``nan``, which used to travel through
``Decimal``/``quantize`` and only blow up at ``int(...)`` with
``ValueError: cannot convert NaN to integer``. Such a cell has to be
